            "value": "話題の映画を観に行きましょう。大画面と音響で、没入感のある体験を。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See the film everyone's talking about, the way it was meant to be seen and heard."
